# 🔟 SQL Revision ⭐⭐⭐

## SELECT

```sql
SELECT * FROM students;
```

## WHERE

```sql
SELECT * 
FROM students
WHERE marks > 80;
```

## GROUP BY

```sql
SELECT department, COUNT(*)
FROM students
GROUP BY department;
```

## HAVING

```sql
SELECT department, COUNT(*)
FROM students
GROUP BY department
HAVING COUNT(*) > 5;
```

### 🚨 Important

```text
WHERE → filters rows BEFORE grouping

HAVING → filters groups AFTER grouping
```

